  "abstract_summary": "Abstract: Real-time object detection on edge devices forces a trade-off between image quality and inference speed, yet both are often reported as a single performance figure. This study examines that trade-off on an NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano paired with a Logitech C922 USB camera for person-capacity monitoring. The fi...",
